<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Signal Wire</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif;
      color: #f7f2ec;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(255,159,67,0.28), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #442412 0%, #0d0f14 60%, #20140f 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .wrap {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 48px 24px 80px;
    }
    .eyebrow { letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ffb36a; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 96px); line-height: 0.95; margin: 12px 0 24px; }
    p { max-width: 560px; color: rgba(247,242,236,0.76); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Signal Infrastructure</div>
    <h1>Routing layers for fast private traffic.</h1>
    <p>Performance-oriented control surfaces for distributed edge systems, with telemetry, delivery paths and traffic shaping tuned for low-friction rollout.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
